                "size": 1951465
            },
            "notes_hu": "A \"Blokkolt levelek\" k\u00e1rtya DNSBL sz\u00e1ma jav\u00edtva: a csak figyelmeztet\u0151 (warn_if_reject) elutas\u00edt\u00e1sok eddig blokkol\u00e1sk\u00e9nt sz\u00e1m\u00edtottak, ami a hetes DNSBL \u00e9rt\u00e9ket jelent\u0151sen felnagy\u00edtotta. A list\u00e1nk\u00e9nti DNSBL bont\u00e1s megsz\u0171nt, mert a napl\u00f3 nem a val\u00f3di tal\u00e1latokat, hanem a leggyorsabban v\u00e1laszol\u00f3 list\u00e1t nevezte meg.",
            "notes_en": "Fixes the DNSBL count on the \"Blocked mail\" card: warn-only (warn_if_reject) events were counted as blocks, substantially inflating the 7-day DNSBL figure. The per-list DNSBL breakdown is removed -- the log names whichever list replied first, not which ones actually matched."
        },
